      "source": "ICAS 2022 Year 2 Mathematics Q2",
      "stem": {
        "en": "Today is Monday {d} June. Which of these statements tells something that WILL happen?",
        "zh": "今天是 6 月 {d} 日，星期一。下面哪一句说的是「一定」会发生的事？"
      },
      "answer": {
        "type": "choice",
        "options": [
          {
            "en": "Tomorrow will be Thursday",
            "zh": "明天将是星期四"
          },
          {
            "en": "Next Monday will be {d+7} June",
            "zh": "下星期一将是 6 月 {d+7} 日"
          },
          {
            "en": "It will be sunny tomorrow as well",
            "zh": "明天也会是晴天"
          }
        ],
        "correctIndex": 1
      },
      "solution": {
        "en": "Tomorrow is Tuesday, not Thursday — that cannot happen. Monday plus 7 days is next Monday: {d}+7={d+7}, so next Monday will definitely be {d+7} June. Whether it is sunny tomorrow is only possible, not certain.",
        "zh": "明天是星期二，不是星期四——一定不会发生；今天星期一，过 7 天正好是下星期一，{d}＋7＝{d+7}，所以下星期一一定是 6 月 {d+7} 日——一定会发生；明天晴不晴要等到才知道——只是可能发生。"
      },
      "sourceSet": "ICAS 2022 Year 2 Mathematics",
      "originalImage": "assets/originals/2022y2m-q02.png",
      "vars": {
        "d": {
          "type": "int",
          "min": 1,
          "max": 23
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "icas22y2m-03",
      "subject": "数学",
