      ],
      "source": "ICAS 2022 Year 2 Mathematics Q3",
      "stem": {
        "en": "Jess made shapes with sticks: shape 1 used {a} sticks, shape 2 used {a+d}, shape 3 used {a+2*d}. Following the pattern, how many sticks are needed for shape {n}?",
        "zh": "杰丝用小棒搭图形：图形 1 用了 {a} 根小棒，图形 2 用了 {a+d} 根，图形 3 用了 {a+2*d} 根。照这个规律，搭图形 {n} 要用多少根小棒？"
      },
      "vars": {
        "a": {
          "type": "pick",
          "from": [
            3,
            4,
            5
          ]
        },
        "d": {
          "type": "pick",
          "from": [
            2,
            3
          ]
        },
        "n": {
          "type": "pick",
          "from": [
            4,
            5,
            6
          ]
        }
      },
      "answer": {
        "type": "integer",
        "expr": "a + (n-1)*d"
      },
      "sanity": {
        "integer": true,
        "min": 1
      },
      "solution": {
        "en": "Each next shape uses {d} more sticks: shape 1 is {a}, shape 2 is {a+d}, shape 3 is {a+2*d}… shape {n} is {n-1} steps after shape 1, so {a}＋{d}×{n-1}＝{a+(n-1)*d} sticks.",
        "zh": "每往后一个图形多用 {d} 根：图形 1 用 {a} 根，图形 2 用 {a+d} 根，图形 3 用 {a+2*d} 根……图形 {n} 比图形 1 多（{n}-1）＝{n-1} 次，所以是 {a}＋{d}×{n-1}＝{a+(n-1)*d} 根。"
      },
      "sourceSet": "ICAS 2022 Year 2 Mathematics",
      "originalImage": "assets/originals/2022y2m-q03.png"
    },
