    {
      "id": "icas22y2m-29",
      "subject": "数学",
      "topic": "符号方程",
      "grade": "二年级",
      "difficulty": 5,
      "title": "三个算式求符号的值",
      "tags": [
        "符号代换",
        "推理"
      ],
      "source": "ICAS 2022 Year 2 Mathematics Q29",
      "stem": {
        "en": "◆＋▲＋●＝ {A}; ▲＋▲＋●＋●＝ {B}; ◆＋◆＋▲＋●＋●＋●＝ {C}. What number does ● stand for?",
        "zh": "◆＋▲＋●＝ {A}；▲＋▲＋●＋●＝ {B}；◆＋◆＋▲＋●＋●＋●＝ {C}。● 代表的数是多少？"
      },
      "vars": {
        "c": {
          "type": "pick",
          "from": [
            5,
            10,
            15,
            20,
            25
          ]
        },
        "t": {
          "type": "int",
          "min": 5,
          "max": 20
        },
        "d": {
          "type": "int",
          "min": 5,
          "max": 15
        }
      },
      "derived": {
        "A": "d + t + c",
        "B": "2*(t + c)",
        "C": "2*d + t + 3*c"
      },
      "constraints": [
        "t != c",
        "d != c",
        "d != t"
      ],
      "answer": {
        "type": "integer",
        "expr": "c"
      },
      "sanity": {
        "integer": true,
        "min": 1
      },
      "solution": {
        "en": "Divide the 2nd equation by 2: ▲＋●＝{B/2}. From the 1st, ◆＝{A}−{B/2}＝{d}. Put into the 3rd: ▲＋3●＝{C}−2×{d}＝{C-2*d}; subtract ▲＋●＝{B/2} to get 2●＝{C-2*d-B/2}, so ●＝{c}.",
        "zh": "第二式两边除以 2：▲＋●＝{B/2}。由第一式：◆＝{A}−{B/2}＝{d}。代入第三式：▲＋3●＝{C}−2×{d}＝{C-2*d}；再减去▲＋●＝{B/2}，得 2●＝{C-2*d-B/2}，所以 ●＝{c}。"
      },
      "sourceSet": "ICAS 2022 Year 2 Mathematics",
      "originalImage": "assets/originals/2022y2m-q29.png"
    },
